Hello,

I am sending a request to add a contact. Below are all the information you may need.

USER ID: {!SendRequest_t_rcuserid}
CONTACT NAME: {!SendRequest_t_contactname}
CONTACT EMAIL ADDRESS: {!var_input_casecontactemail}
CONTACT NUMBER: {!SendRequest_t_contactnumber}

Regards,
{!var_user_userdetails.Name}
